$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Xaos" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Late Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> In the dark of night, two teams battle it out between their two upright bases.  Steal the other team's cherry . . . uh, I mean flag 8 times and win the match.  Then and only then can you go to sleep." @
	"\n<f1>Concept and build: <f0> Goldberg of Mapper's Extreme";
         
